id: punishing-toss
name: Punishing Toss
advancement: true
prerequisite: Opening Flip
tpCost: 6
# "If you knock an Opponent Prone through the effects of Judo Toss and the Opening Flip Advancement while you are not in
# a High Environment, they suffer Collision with a Square they are occupying" - its Collision Damage asked as the Prone
# is.
judoPunish: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Flipped Prone by Judo Toss while you are not in a High Environment: they suffer Collision with their Square.
text: >
  Punishing Toss: Your foe hits the ground with painful force.
  –Prerequisites: Opening Flip
  –TP Cost: 6
  –Effect: If you knock an Opponent Prone through the effects of Judo Toss and the Opening Flip Advancement while you are
  not in a High Environment, they suffer Collision with a Square they are occupying (if they are occupying multiple, you
  decide which Square).
